{
  "name": "charge-band-mix-visual",
  "description": "#2203: the Charge step names, per hole, the powder factor, band mix and recommended range, and shows each explosive card the band mix it would give the pattern. Player clicks only: compare two cards, pick one, charge a hole, read the row.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "command": "new_game seed:42 staffed:true cash:320000",
      "timeout": 30,
      "description": "Staffed opening (#551): a driller with blasting + drill_rig licence, a blaster, plus a charging truck (#1649: charge_hole is worked from a truck by a blasting + truck-licensed driver), plus an unmanned drill_rig, are hired/purchased for free at game-open — #553's automatic drill dispatch needs both to ever land an ordered hole.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "new_game seed:42 staffed:true cash:320000"
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "holeCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "drill_plan grid rows:2 cols:3 spacing:4 depth:6 start:15,15",
      "description": "The grid tool's spacing stepper defaults to 3m (DEFAULT_SPACING_M, Drill.ts); one increment click on the strip's spacing stepper (data-field=\"spacing\") raises it to 4 before dragging, so the (15,15)-(23,19) rectangle (8x4) computes the declared 3 cols x 2 rows instead of the default-spacing 4x2 (issue #479 follow-up, Finding #4). #553: confirming the grid queues 6 drill_hole PendingActions and pushes 6 PlannedHoles into plannedDrillHoles — none are drilled yet, so holeCount stays 0 right after confirm.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickIfPresent",
          "selector": "#bs-inspector [data-panel-close]",
          "timeoutMs": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"blast\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"grid-tool\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "setStepper",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"spacing\"]",
          "value": 4
        },
        {
          "type": "setStepper",
          "selector": "#bs-param-strip [data-field=\"depth\"]",
          "value": 6
        },
        {
          "type": "dragTiles",
          "x1": 15,
          "z1": 15,
          "x2": 23,
          "z2": 19
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 6,
          "holeCount": 0
        },
        "note": "2 rows x 3 cols = 6 holes ordered (ghosts), none drilled yet (#553)"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:holeCount equals:6 max_ticks:300",
      "description": "#553: drain the ordered plan -- the staffed driller/drill_rig lands all 6 holes. #1339: wait on the 6th hole landing instead of a fixed 130-tick pad: payroll runs every tick, and the extra licences now held by the staffed drivers raise it enough that the idle pad left too little cash for the later 8 kg recharge.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "holeCount",
          "equals": 6,
          "maxTicks": 300,
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "orderedHoleCount": 0,
          "holeCount": 6
        },
        "note": "All 6 holes have landed — none lost, none left ordered forever."
      },
      "timeout": 125
    },
    {
      "command": "state",
      "timeout": 60,
      "role": "player",
      "description": "#2203: the player opens the Charge step. With holes drilled but nothing charged, each explosive card shows the band mix that explosive would give this pattern at the chosen kg, so two cards can be compared by eye.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "ensurePanel",
          "panel": "blast"
        },
        {
          "type": "ensureStep",
          "step": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"select-explosive\"][data-explosive=\"pop_rock\"] [data-role=\"explosive-band-mix\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"select-explosive\"][data-explosive=\"boomite\"] [data-role=\"explosive-band-mix\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "usable": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"select-explosive\"][data-explosive=\"boomite\"]"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "state",
      "timeout": 60,
      "role": "player",
      "description": "#2203: the player selects boomite then pop_rock; the hole rows show the recommended powder-factor range for the selected explosive (no charge needed), and it follows the selection.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"select-explosive\"][data-explosive=\"boomite\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole] [data-role=\"hole-recommended\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"select-explosive\"][data-explosive=\"pop_rock\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole] [data-role=\"hole-recommended\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "usable": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole][data-charged=\"false\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "charge hole:H1 explosive:boomite amount:5 stemming:2",
      "role": "player",
      "description": "#2203: the player charges hole the first hole with the selected card by clicking its row button (orders the charge; the blaster loads it next step).",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-action=\"select-explosive\"][data-explosive=\"boomite\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole][data-charged=\"false\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:chargedCount equals:1 max_ticks:3000",
      "timeout": 125,
      "role": "setup",
      "description": "Drain the one charge order.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "chargedCount",
          "equals": 1,
          "maxTicks": 3000,
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "chargedCount": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "state",
      "timeout": 60,
      "role": "player",
      "description": "#2203: the charged row shows its powder factor and band mix.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole][data-charged=\"true\"] [data-role=\"hole-powder-factor\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole][data-charged=\"true\"] [data-role=\"hole-band-mix\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "usable": "#bs-blast-panel [data-hole][data-charged=\"false\"] [data-action=\"charge-hole\"]"
      }
    }
  ],
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "overview",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 45
    },
    {
      "name": "closeup",
      "yaw": 90,
      "pitch": 10
    },
    {
      "name": "birdseye",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 80
    }
  ]
}
